# Redirects for pages that have moved.
#
# Format: <from-path> <to-path> <status>. GitLab Pages reads this file from the
# root of the published site; zensical copies anything in docs/ that is not a
# page (this file included) to the site root verbatim, so it lands at
# https://controls.go.phpboyscout.uk/_redirects.
#
# Zensical has no redirects plugin (it implements search, offline, mike and
# mkdocstrings only), so this file is the mechanism. Keep an entry here for the
# lifetime of any URL that was ever published; other projects' docs and blog
# posts link to these paths.

# The getting-started walkthrough moved into the tutorials tier (Diátaxis).
/getting-started /tutorials/getting-started/ 301
/getting-started/ /tutorials/getting-started/ 301
/getting-started/index.html /tutorials/getting-started/ 301
